    "summaryAr": "About the role Space helps people and AI agents work with files and collaborate. The Space Foundations team builds the shared systems that make those experiences fast, reliable, and consistent. We’re looking for a hands-on engineer who can take a capability like file sharing from the real-time systems that power it through to the interface people use. In this role, you will: Design, build, and operate real-time syste",
    "descriptionAr": "About the role Space helps people and AI agents work with files and collaborate. The Space Foundations team builds the shared systems that make those experiences fast, reliable, and consistent. We’re looking for a hands-on engineer who can take a capability like file sharing from the real-time systems that power it through to the interface people use. In this role, you will: Design, build, and operate real-time systems that support collaboration across Space. Build shared capabilities such as file sharing and make them work consistently across product experiences. Identify and fix reliability and latency issues across backend services and frontend experiences. Work with partner teams to understand how people and agents use Space and turn those needs into platform improvements. You might thrive in this role if you: Have built and operated real-time or distributed systems in production. Are comfortable moving between infrastructure and frontend code and owning a feature end to end. Can explain technical tradeoffs clearly and use product judgment to decide what to build and where to simplify. Are curious about how people work and what makes a platform easy for people and agents to use. About OpenAI OpenAI is an AI research and deployment company dedicated to ensuring that general-purpose artificial intelligence benefits all of humanity. We push the boundaries of the capabilities of AI systems and seek to safely deploy them to the world through our products. AI is an extremely powerful tool that must be created with safety and human needs at its core, and to achieve our mission, we must encompass and value the many different perspectives, voices, and experiences that form the full spectrum of humanity. We are an equal opportunity employer, and we do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability, genetic information, or other applicable legally protected characteristic. For additional information, please see OpenAI’s Affirmative Action and Equal Employment Opportunity Policy Statement . Background checks for applicants will be administered in accordance with applicable law, and qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records will be considered for employment consistent with those laws, including the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, the Los Angeles County Fair Chance Ordinance for Employers, and the California Fair Chance Act, for US-based candidates. For unincorporated Los Angeles County workers: we reasonably believe that criminal history may have a direct, adverse and negative relationship with the following job duties, potentially resulting in the withdrawal of a conditional offer of employment: protect computer hardware entrusted to you from theft, loss or damage; return all computer hardware in your possession (including the data contained therein) upon termination of employment or end of assignment; and maintain the confidentiality of proprietary, confidential, and non-public information. In addition, job duties require access to secure and protected information technology systems and related data security obligations. To notify OpenAI that you believe this job posting is non-compliant, please submit a report through this form . No response will be provided to inquiries unrelated to job posting compliance. We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with disabilities, and requests can be made via this link . OpenAI Global Applicant Privacy Policy At OpenAI, we believe artificial intelligence has the potential to help people solve immense global challenges, and we want the upside of AI to be widely shared. Join us in shaping the future of technology.",
