    "descriptionAr": "About the team Applied AI Engineering helps customers build, deploy, and run useful AI systems with OpenAI products. We work alongside customer engineers and technical partners, and bring what we learn back to Product and Research. About the role You’ll lead AIE for SMB and Mid-Market customers globally. The opportunity is to make engineering support effective across a broad customer base: choose where direct involvement matters most, help customers reach production, and make successful approaches easier to repeat across regions. In this role, you will Build and develop a customer-facing engineering team, set clear standards, and keep ownership close to the work. Agree coverage and priorities with regional Sales and Applied AI Architecture (AAA) leaders; make explicit choices about dedicated and scaled support. Turn recurring deployment problems into reusable implementations, evaluations, tooling, and delivery practices. Set a practical bar for model quality, reliability, safety, latency, and cost, and help the team resolve difficult technical decisions. Measure sustained production use and customer value, and use the evidence to improve where the organization spends its time. You might thrive in this role if you Have led customer-facing engineering teams with responsibility for people, technical quality, and production delivery. Can make sound decisions about AI applications and explain the trade-offs to engineers, customers, and commercial partners. Have helped an organization serve a broad portfolio through repeatable practices while preserving depth where it matters. Have made difficult hiring, performance, and resource decisions, and can show how your leadership improved others’ effectiveness. Work well across regions and build trust while resolving competing customer and business priorities. About OpenAI OpenAI is an AI research and deployment company dedicated to ensuring that general-purpose artificial intelligence benefits all of humanity. We push the boundaries of the capabilities of AI systems and seek to safely deploy them to the world through our products. AI is an extremely powerful tool that must be created with safety and human needs at its core, and to achieve our mission, we must encompass and value the many different perspectives, voices, and experiences that form the full spectrum of humanity. We are an equal opportunity employer, and we do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability, genetic information, or other applicable legally protected characteristic. For additional information, please see OpenAI’s Affirmative Action and Equal Employment Opportunity Policy Statement . Background checks for applicants will be administered in accordance with applicable law, and qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records will be considered for employment consistent with those laws, including the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, the Los Angeles County Fair Chance Ordinance for Employers, and the California Fair Chance Act, for US-based candidates. For unincorporated Los Angeles County workers: we reasonably believe that criminal history may have a direct, adverse and negative relationship with the following job duties, potentially resulting in the withdrawal of a conditional offer of employment: protect computer hardware entrusted to you from theft, loss or damage; return all computer hardware in your possession (including the data contained therein) upon termination of employment or end of assignment; and maintain the confidentiality of proprietary, confidential, and non-public information. In addition, job duties require access to secure and protected information technology systems and related data security obligations. To notify OpenAI that you believe this job posting is non-compliant, please submit a report through this form . No response will be provided to inquiries unrelated to job posting compliance. We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with disabilities, and requests can be made via this link . OpenAI Global Applicant Privacy Policy At OpenAI, we believe artificial intelligence has the potential to help people solve immense global challenges, and we want the upside of AI to be widely shared. Join us in shaping the future of technology.",
